c_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=wO4i5kmvaAMQ7kNvwGomKtu&_nc_oc=AdqZy0b23jXO0nDmiL5-WV43XL0OVichZ6QQ5jQUZmGzdewVv6bjUIAKqtqHRNSkLYw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQBpoOEqPKvhGieXCSVXA-yIA5qd2nGe3cNXPzzEhKxxcg&oe=6A4FB623"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "motor grader - trailer cover.png", "id": "840143774838027", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/86597262_840143778171360_6047656471363500610_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=_1-xoRVpVVMQ7kNvwFs92Ud&_nc_oc=AdoPCRs0Q5Ew7-mogl-kCM7sdctlftYgyRnXlpOhb27g0PkT_AfFcR74yKnc5RNW1Yg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQC6IMsj8S7QyCxwoSrVOPrLsUT1sm5e69DD75Lxz6TB3w&oe=6A4FADD0"}, "display_name": "Motor Grader Safety and Operation", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Motor graders are versatile machines that play a pivotal role in various projects. Participants will operate a bulldozer and complete various tasks on an active worksite as part of this engaging simulation. \n\n**Overview & Activities:**\n\nParticipants begin with an overview that provides context and helps identify key parts and components outside and inside the vehicle, safety tips, and the basics of a walk-around inspection performed before using any heavy machinery. Participants engage in a sort-and-match activity to reinforce essential controls and their location inside the vehicle. They are then asked to perform a single task to become familiar with operating the vehicle in a VR environment. \n\n**Participant Simulation:**\n\nBefore starting their simulation tasks, participants must wear personal protective equipment (PPE), conduct a walk-around inspection of the vehicle, and complete one task to familiarize themselves with the vehicle's operation. Finally, participants are challenged to complete tasks at an active worksite, including leveling a small hill, moving piles of dirt into targeted areas, and filling a trench with rocks and